00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.352
what's new in networking.

00:00:07.352 --> 00:00:08.310
This is Stephanie Wong.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.100
And, today, we'll be covering
our core infrastructure

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.150
updates.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.590
We'll cover some new shared VPC
capabilities as well as new MTU

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.420
